has really been at the center of my existence and my world,

00:01:23,060 --> 00:01:24,140
my world mentally.

00:01:24,140 --> 00:01:26,580
This is what I've been studying pretty much my whole life.

00:01:26,580 --> 00:01:29,900
I'm going to be three decades now pretty soon.

