And the initial portion of my study

00:01:36,100 --> 00:01:38,980
was very much dedicated to athletic performance

00:01:38,980 --> 00:01:41,860
and body building and body composition.

00:01:41,860 --> 00:01:44,740
And that was my world for a very long time.

00:01:44,740 --> 00:01:46,020
I was very dedicated to it.

00:01:46,020 --> 00:01:49,140
I was very gifted in that area.

00:01:49,140 --> 00:01:51,620
By the time I was 14 years old,

00:01:51,620 --> 00:01:54,780
I was reading college-level textbooks on nutrition

00:01:54,780 --> 00:01:57,580
and exercise physiology and things like that.

00:01:57,580 --> 00:02:02,380
And I think that also gave me a really unique

00:02:02,380 --> 00:02:04,260
background.

