My older brother, who we were just talking about,

00:02:06,340 --> 00:02:09,660
who's a chiropractor, was my best friend from a very young age.

00:02:09,660 --> 00:02:12,180
He was also dedicated to health.

00:02:12,180 --> 00:02:15,740
He was a body builder and personal trainer

00:02:15,740 --> 00:02:18,380
from the time I was very young and being

00:02:18,380 --> 00:02:21,300
mentored by a professional body builder.

00:02:21,300 --> 00:02:25,820
And so I had this introduction from a very young age

00:02:25,820 --> 00:02:29,180
to that world, which was really biohacking

00:02:29,180 --> 00:02:32,260
before biohacking was a term.

00:02:32,260 --> 00:02:34,540
The original biohackers were body builders.

00:02:34,540 --> 00:02:39,060
And this kind of knowledge is a very unique kind of knowledge

00:02:39,060 --> 00:02:40,900
