00:10:51,820 --> 00:10:52,820
Okay, we did it.

00:10:52,820 --> 00:10:57,660
We got those biomarkers in ranges that says you are not diabetic

00:10:57,660 --> 00:10:59,580
or you don't have high blood pressure,

00:10:59,580 --> 00:11:00,900
hypertension anymore.

00:11:01,900 --> 00:11:04,460
And then we assume that you're healthy,

00:11:04,460 --> 00:11:05,460
but you're not healthy.

00:11:05,460 --> 00:11:07,780
You're actually, your physiology is still very much

00:11:07,780 --> 00:11:11,980
the product of the same lifestyle and environmental inputs

00:11:12,060 --> 00:11:14,940
that led to those dysfunctions in the first place.

00:11:14,940 --> 00:11:19,380
And if you take drugs to change those numbers a little bit,

00:11:19,380 --> 00:11:21,140
that doesn't mean you're healthier.

00:11:21,140 --> 00:11:22,860
And it doesn't live longer.

00:11:22,860 --> 00:11:26,260
Yeah, I've always told people like taking something

