00:12:05,220 --> 00:12:08,140
if for people, because we're so indoctrinated

00:12:08,140 --> 00:12:10,620
into this conventional medical paradigm,

00:12:10,620 --> 00:12:14,380
a drug for every disease, and where it's assumed

00:12:14,380 --> 00:12:17,020
that taking a drug to normalize that biomarker

00:12:17,020 --> 00:12:19,580
