00:12:27,260 --> 00:12:30,580
and gave them five different drugs, a blood pressure drug,

00:12:30,580 --> 00:12:38,060
a blood sugar drug, a drug for whatever other,

00:12:38,060 --> 00:12:41,060
things, an anti-depressant, and so on?

00:12:41,060 --> 00:12:43,980
Would we expect that healthy person to be healthier

00:12:43,980 --> 00:12:47,940
as a result of those inputs or less healthy?

00:12:47,940 --> 00:12:49,740
Less healthy.

00:12:49,740 --> 00:12:55,780
And this is very obvious that we can expect much more net harm

00:12:55,780 --> 00:12:57,620
than good by taking a healthy person

00:12:57,620 --> 00:13:00,260
and putting them on several different drugs.

00:13:00,260 --> 00:13:02,540
But we assume that taking a disease person

